[statement]
Only a provided name whose one candidate depends directly on a real name is
decided before it: `w`'s candidate `kw` needs `x2`, whose candidate `px`
needs the real `dep`. `x2` is decided early, but `w` waits its turn after
`v`, which goes to `gk`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1
D:x2

P:px
V:1
p:x2=1
D:dep

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install dep 1
install px 1
install kw 1
install app 1
